{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a0a98fbd1f061a16d7a4b0a8dc7b8a60178ec9b2a06796863dfb6e030fc2321", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\n奈緒のコンセプトは『関西の女子高生』……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n奈绪的主题是“关西女高中生”……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f14261b373754ba124f29b4c84a634455607aa370e9e721f05498ee9c73643e1", "ja": "（馴染みのあるテーマだけあって、撮影は順調。\n早いペースで前半が終わり、今は休憩中だ）", "zh": "（毕竟是熟悉的主题，拍摄进行得很顺利。前半部分很快就结束了，现在正在休息）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "7fde4f96a79e2f7eb918a27ca989a4fd2e96d7de03bc6af09d978f4efd513f48", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cff37ce13246e9115651f6e5e9db7ae790dfdae393bd14eb61e40e64888fb566", "ja": "お疲れさま、奈緒。さっきからスマホを見てるけど、\nゲームでもやってるのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，奈绪。你从刚才开始就在看手机，是在玩游戏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "bb36da9a6ea8075da57e5ccf4c5a2af4ac12d77cacfebf8de0545d48e9231ecb", "ja": "あはは、ちゃいますよー！\nちょっと大阪の友達にメールしよかなーと思って。", "zh": "啊哈哈，才不是啦～！\n我只是在想要不要给大阪的朋友发条邮件呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "4c880683a3008d6fa69d8090b284141b988e69083f6aca23095e9311cb48d1b1", "ja": "東京で私はがんばっとるでーってこと、\n報告せなアカンしな♪", "zh": "得跟他们说一声，我在东京也努力着呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6d294840d864e776a9eabd3adcf3063d227e0186410aa4e8f11bc96754209a0a", "ja": "そうか。\n奈緒は地元の友達と、本当に仲がいいんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。奈绪和家乡的朋友们，关系真的很好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "c6a72917391143e27c3293910475067eae294e8d1ec4652ca66265e70a494121", "ja": "もちろんです！　引っ越しても、\nいっぱい連絡するって約束したんで！", "zh": "当然啦！我们约好了，就算搬家了，也要经常联系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "8c293153d8a94a98718bf54a2184b7f2e5c79fdf0c2627884a2c665a28b00be8", "ja": "せやから最初の頃は、東京の面白いとことか、\n大阪と違うとことか、よう送ってました。", "zh": "所以刚开始的时候，我经常把东京有意思的地方，还有和大阪不同的地方发给她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "74d31c49d65827a6e9300abf56973ae6f5cddeb256adda23b0378affc507e584", "ja": "ホンマは、会ってしゃべったり、\n写真めっちゃ見せたりしたいんやけど……。", "zh": "其实，我很想和你见面聊聊天，\n给你看好多好多照片……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1010_p", "source_sha256": "22d8795cb1841e652d9a0fb921bedbc2a68e7ba383f7bd8ada43dbea8f1858fb", "ja": "東京と大阪だと、\n簡単に会える距離じゃないもんな。", "zh": "东京和大阪之间，也不是能轻易见面的距离嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "95a42d0d040c8ebe31e6a6f17132a72797606d5a9ccb0a02fa0521c0070a51ff", "ja": "そうなんです～！　せやから、報告だけでも～と\n思って……あっ！　いいこと思いついた！", "zh": "就是这样～！所以我想，哪怕只是报告一下也好～……啊！我想到一个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "6112568e92acecf258bdefe4f742a5c01607b349d438500d9dc84034dec0686c", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　後半の撮影、\n東京の高校生っぽくしてみてもいいですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！后半段的拍摄，\n我可以试着表现得像东京的高中生那样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6750c2df131a4a24cfa0077e0ebb2b8002b7856d96ce9eeb2a3e391ea453c941", "ja": "東京の高校生っぽく？　……って、どんなんだ？", "zh": "像东京的高中生？……这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "353e73cfbe80266b246f424728e61713d60949655d2ffee36fd5deb7537c5ca2", "ja": "わからへんけど、その方がええやん！\nみんなが雑誌を見た時、びっくりするやろ？", "zh": "虽然我也不清楚，但那样不是挺好吗！\n大家看到杂志的时候，肯定会大吃一惊吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "7ebb897bac1c423636b8796b7a8b4c794aaaf498a50c8b8e5141e0d10cd3dee1", "ja": "『関西の女子高生と東京の女子高生』……\n私ひとりのグラビアで、2回おいしいやんな♪", "zh": "《关西女高中生和东京女高中生》……靠我一个人的写真，就能一举享受2次呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e189e7334afa004c6c0de38cd79bec547e41f1f648bcbf67eae771ff04f16d63", "ja": "なるほど、確かに面白そうだな。\nよし、スタッフさんに提案してみるか。", "zh": "原来如此，确实挺有意思的。\n好，那就试着向工作人员提议一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "7ab96a2354da4e642b77e128c60f89e0e94a85b7c2422f35b8f4304303af7f5c", "ja": "よっしゃー！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "太好啦——！\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "d0ab36a575fa75baa66f63de6e61f9ee8f723d0d11293d810949fe60de68df9f", "ja": "ん？　……でも東京の高校生と大阪の高校生って、\n具体的に何がちゃうんやろ？", "zh": "嗯？……不过东京的高中生和高中的大阪生，\n具体是有哪里不一样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "ce9137d31ab74f2f31e9e47a46797ecb45d61711ddc1f9b1213d1b6bea9434a9", "ja": "やっぱ言葉遣い？\n……いやいや、そんなん写真じゃ伝わらへんし。", "zh": "果然还是说话方式？\n……不对不对，这种东西单凭照片又传达不出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "a282f5890399487b3c13d2b317538d890612d4e560aee43afa74d048394db0bc", "ja": "アカン！　自分で言うといてわからへん！\n{$P$}さん、どないしましょう！？", "zh": "不行！我自己说出来都搞不懂！\n{$P$}先生，这可怎么办啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e0cb533b71a70e4adc11e034128af5f316f5ff872f604c68283cf44804eed9bd", "ja": "ま、まあまあ……それじゃまずは、\n東京と大阪の女子高生の違い。そこからだな！", "zh": "嘛、总之……那就先从东京和大阪的女高中生之间的差异开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0163_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bae7803595fe63087206cc5caee93712a8e633c6a40cf9156877cfa70ea6d436", "ja": "（その後、スタッフさん達と試行錯誤の末、2つの\nコンセプトの撮影が行われた。いい経験になったな！）", "zh": "（之后，和工作人员们反复摸索，完成了2个概念的拍摄。真是一次很好的经历啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
